WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.252
Everyone has a story.

00:00:02.252 --> 00:00:03.461
You're gonna fall right out of your seat.

00:00:03.461 --> 00:00:08.049
But some stories are so incredible, 
they deserve to be immortalized

00:00:08.049 --> 00:00:09.384
on television.

00:00:09.384 --> 00:00:11.011
What genre would you call this story?

00:00:11.011 --> 00:00:11.678
Horror mystery. 

00:00:11.678 --> 00:00:12.220
Action.

00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:13.054
Inspirational.

00:00:13.054 --> 00:00:15.098
Join Ed Helms and Randall Park.

00:00:15.098 --> 00:00:17.308
Where and when does this story begin?

00:00:17.308 --> 00:00:18.143
In Nebraska.

00:00:18.143 --> 00:00:19.352
Alexandria, Virginia.

00:00:19.352 --> 00:00:21.479
As they hear ordinary people...

00:00:21.479 --> 00:00:22.063
Hi!

00:00:22.063 --> 00:00:22.939
How's it going, y'all?

00:00:22.939 --> 00:00:24.858
...tell extraordinary true stories.

00:00:24.858 --> 00:00:25.859
They made a typo, obviously.

00:00:25.859 --> 00:00:27.944
And I just said, "****ing count me in."

00:00:27.944 --> 00:00:30.530
Woah! Wait a minute. Wait a minute.

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:33.158
Hold on, I thought you were a 
Dungeons and Dragons guy.

00:00:33.158 --> 00:00:33.867
I'm telling you.

00:00:33.867 --> 00:00:37.328
Then, bring them to life
with a star-studded cast.

00:00:37.328 --> 00:00:38.413
Pretty incredible, huh?

00:00:38.413 --> 00:00:40.165
My parents were extremely strict.

00:00:40.165 --> 00:00:42.459
Hey yo! Have fun tonight Ronald.

00:00:42.459 --> 00:00:45.045
What? Fun? At this hour?

00:00:45.045 --> 00:00:46.963
-Have fun.
-You're like, "Be cool!"

00:00:46.963 --> 00:00:49.591
-I never liked him.
-Bad influence.

00:00:49.591 --> 00:00:50.633
Yeah, he's not even saved.

00:00:50.633 --> 00:00:51.926
Ha ha!

00:00:51.926 --> 00:00:53.470
What if you guys tried being me for a day?

00:00:53.470 --> 00:00:55.305
They’re like, “Oh, like real smart and weird?”

00:00:55.305 --> 00:00:56.681
No, I was thinking more so...

00:00:59.642 --> 00:01:01.061
I am blown away.

00:01:01.061 --> 00:01:02.812
You are an incredible person.

00:01:02.812 --> 00:01:05.023
What do you think about going down 
and getting the football?

00:01:05.023 --> 00:01:07.025
And he says one of the dumbest 
things I've ever heard.

00:01:07.025 --> 00:01:10.070
Your immediate response is,
"That's a great idea."

00:01:10.070 --> 00:01:12.030
I see this beautiful girl.

00:01:12.030 --> 00:01:12.781
She was just glowing.

00:01:12.781 --> 00:01:15.742
I kept looking at her, a little bit too much.

00:01:15.742 --> 00:01:18.161
-It was awkward.
-You mean like this?

00:01:20.413 --> 00:01:21.247
Ha ha!

00:01:21.247 --> 00:01:22.290
Remember that.

00:01:24.250 --> 00:01:25.376
Who the frig are you?

00:01:25.376 --> 00:01:27.545
I would punch you in your stupid face, 
but I don't wanna get grease

00:01:27.545 --> 00:01:29.214
on my new championship ring.

00:01:29.214 --> 00:01:30.465
Stories so amazing...

00:01:30.465 --> 00:01:33.176
It wasn't an allergic reaction. They're very poisonous.

00:01:33.176 --> 00:01:34.803
So dramatic.

00:01:34.803 --> 00:01:36.137
Is he gonna propose to me?

00:01:36.137 --> 00:01:37.388
So ridiculous...

00:01:37.388 --> 00:01:39.307
Literal projectile vomit.

00:01:40.183 --> 00:01:43.394
So unbelievable, they could only be true.

00:01:43.394 --> 00:01:45.188
You snuck in the Super Bowl!

00:01:45.188 --> 00:01:47.982
All the way to the bus,
bus guy opens the door,

00:01:47.982 --> 00:01:49.567
Bradshaw's right in front of me.

00:01:49.567 --> 00:01:50.693
You guys are badass!

00:01:50.693 --> 00:01:52.987
That was the best game I've ever seen!

00:01:52.987 --> 00:01:54.280
Wait, who was that?

00:01:54.280 --> 00:01:56.783
I think that was the coach's nephew. Maybe.

00:01:58.118 --> 00:01:59.410
And that’s the end of my story.

00:01:59.410 --> 00:02:00.328
That’s my story, brothers.

00:02:00.328 --> 00:02:01.246
That's the story guys.

00:02:01.246 --> 00:02:04.749
-Yes! You did it!
-Yes!

